<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-158> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-158-logic-deontic-3>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-158-logic-deontic-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "=";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Definition";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "freezing order means an order that is made under a State or Territory proceeds of crime law and that is of a kind declared by the regulations to be a freezing order for the purposes of this paragraph.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "State or Territory proceeds of crime law is a freezing order if it is of a kind declared by the regulations";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-158> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-158-logic-argumentation-4>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-158-logic-argumentation-4> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Argumentation>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "=";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Implication";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "If an order is made under a State or Territory proceeds of crime law and that is of a kind declared by the regulations to be a freezing order for the purposes of this paragraph, then it is a freezing order";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "State or Territory proceeds of crime law implies freezing order if it is of a kind declared by the regulations";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::argumentation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
