    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "Freezing order under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 includes freezing order made under State or Territory proceeds of crime law";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "State or Territory proceeds of crime law is included in freezing order under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002";
